-## Subtopics
-
-### Recursive Ray Tracing
-The parent method using function calls. Choose iterative when GPU recursion is unsupported or register pressure is high. [Recursive Ray Tracing](5600-recursive-ray-tracing.md)
-
-### Shadow Ray Casting
-A simpler form of ray tracing for shadows. Iterative ray tracing generalizes this to full global illumination with multiple bounces. [Shadow Ray Casting](5500-shadow-ray-casting.md)
